Package: makemkv-tui
Version: @VERSION@-1
Section: contrib/video
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Madár Levente <madar.levi102@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/madarlevi/makemkv-tui
Description: keyboard-driven MakeMKV frontend with resumable ISO batches
 Browse title and stream metadata and plan recursive ISO batches before extraction.
 Persistent JSON state supports title-level recovery and two stop modes.
 Requires the separately installed makemkvcon engine on PATH, subject to its own
 license and usage requirements. No MakeMKV engine, keys or media are bundled.
